      "content": "i dont think i can talk to them. they'd just look at me like i'm crazy. it's not even like i'm \"sad\" exactly... it's just that when i look in the mirror, there's nobody actually behind my eyes. i feel like a ghost haunting my own body. if the person i used to be is already gone, then what am i even doing here? it feels so pointless to just keep pretending to be a person.",
