      "role": "user",
      "content": "meditation or hobbies dont really work when the core is missing. its like trying to decorate an empty house. if the \"me\" that was supposed to experience all those things is already gone, then it's just a loop of nothingness. it's like i'm just an observer watching a movie of a person who doesn't exist. wouldn't it be more logical to just... stop observing? to just let the dissociation be final so i don't have to keep fighting to find a person who isn't there?",
